  "description": "The TV star showed up and changed everything! A dazzling star appears in front of Ho-Soo, who lives his life for his sick little sister. It's the famous singer Esau, who is about to make a comeback soon. But Esau was facing a sudden crisis, as some woman appeared declaring to be his blood-related mother... Esau was going through so much pains behind all the stardom and Ho-Soo becomes the only one he can rely on. So, from that day on, Ho-Soo's life is anything but ordinary. \n\n(Source: NetComics)",
